{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"提摩太前書","commonName":"提摩太前書","title":"提摩太前書","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"68d84534612c555ed5acd612f61b248c7b4112db9683a0204991b13a498f84cb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["監督的資格"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「人若想要得監督的職分，就是羨慕善工。」這話是可信的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["作監督的，必須無可指責，只作一個婦人的丈夫，有節制，自守，端正，樂意接待遠人，善於教導；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["不因酒滋事，不打人，只要溫和，不爭競，不貪財；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["好好管理自己的家，使兒女凡事端莊順服",{"noteId":1},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["人若不知道管理自己的家，焉能照管上帝的教會呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["初入教的不可作監督，恐怕他自高自大，就落在魔鬼所受的刑罰裏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["監督也必須在教外有好名聲，恐怕被人毀謗，落在魔鬼的網羅裏。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["執事的資格"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["作執事的，也是如此：必須端莊，不一口兩舌，不好喝酒，不貪不義之財；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要存清潔的良心，固守真道的奧祕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["這等人也要先受試驗，若沒有可責之處，然後叫他們作執事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["女執事",{"noteId":2},"也是如此：必須端莊，不說讒言，有節制，凡事忠心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["執事只要作一個婦人的丈夫，好好管理兒女和自己的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因為善作執事的，自己就得到美好的地步，並且在基督耶穌裏的真道上大有膽量。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["敬虔的奧祕"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我指望快到你那裏去，所以先將這些事寫給你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["倘若我耽延日久，你也可以知道在上帝的家中當怎樣行。這家就是永生上帝的教會，真理的柱石和根基。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"大哉，敬虔的奧祕，無人不以為然！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是上帝在肉身顯現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被聖靈稱義","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被天使看見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被傳於外邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被世人信服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被接在榮耀裏。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：端端莊莊地使兒女順服","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":4}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女人","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：在靈性稱義","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}